    <title>Home</title>
  </head>
  <body>
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/about/">About</a>
      <a href="/blog/">Blog</a>
      <h1>Home</h1>
      <h2>... and my new Astro site!</h2>
      <p>I've used <a href="https://claude.com">Claude Code</a>, <a href="https://zed.dev">Zed editor</a>, and <a href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a> to build this site. Soon, I might install <a href="https://tina.io/">Tina CMS</a> because so far, I really like working with <a href="https://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/index.text">Markdown files.</a></p>
  </body>
</html>
